menu "Provision"

config PROVISION_ALLOW_HTTP
    bool "Allow plain-http base URLs (dev bench only)"
    default n
    help
        When set, the provisioning console accepts an http:// base URL so
        the board can sync against a local opshub without TLS
        (docs/BENCH-TEST.md). Dev profile only: the prod build keeps this
        unset and rejects anything but https:// (asserted in CI).

endmenu
